{"author":{"id":"53b38b4189542570b1a723cdea9ea54af99104fbc59b44537f04a0e63f4629c5"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795290097,"nonce":"vAs+nAFDxyLs+JyWzIwCdHhUMYQ=","title":"L3 — Adwaita design tokens, light/dark theme with toggle","message":"## Context\n`src/styles/global.css:4` defines Catppuccin-ish tokens (`primary-light/dark`, `background-*`, `card-*`) used via `dark:` variants; dark mode follows only the OS. Target: libadwaita (https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/libadwaita/doc/1-latest/named-colors.html) named colors, dark = morghulis black-Adwaita, light = stock Adwaita light, accent Adwaita purple.\n\n## Files\n- `src/styles/global.css:4` — replace `@theme` with Adwaita named-color tokens\n- `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro:11` — `data-theme` on `\u003chtml\u003e`, inline no-flash script in `\u003chead\u003e`, font links\n- `src/components/ThemeToggle.astro` — new, header button (sun/moon icon via existing `icon-[...]` syntax)\n- `src/components/Header.astro:19` — mount the toggle\n\n## Approach\n- Dark values verbatim from `../morghulis/data/scss/app.css:1-77` (window #000000, view/headerbar/popover #1e1e1e, card rgba(255,255,255,.08), dialog #383838, headerbar border #3d3846, palette `--blue-1..--dark-5`)\n- Light values from libadwaita defaults (window #fafafb, view/card #ffffff, headerbar #ffffff, fg rgb(0 0 6 / 80%)); take exact values from the libadwaita named-colors doc\n- Accent: light `--purple-3` #9141ac, dark `--purple-1` #dc8add for text, `--purple-3` for bg (follow libadwaita accent/accent-bg split)\n- Expose tokens to Tailwind via `@theme` (e.g. `--color-window-bg: var(--window-bg-color)`) so utilities flip with theme, removing `dark:` pairs\n- Tailwind 4 `@custom-variant dark` bound to `[data-theme=dark]`\n- Mode: follow `prefers-color-scheme`; toggle overrides, saved to localStorage (try/catch); re-apply on `astro:after-swap` because of `ClientRouter`\n- Font: Adwaita Sans / Adwaita Mono with Inter / system fallback; drop Space Grotesk\n- Radii from libadwaita (cards 12px, buttons 6px, pill 9999px)\n- Keep legacy token names as aliases until L4/L5 move components over, so the site is not unstyled mid-stack\n\n## Depends on\nL2 — gates must pass on new files\n\n## Out of scope\n- Restyling individual components (L4, L5)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Toggle switches light/dark, persists across reload and across `ClientRouter` navigation\n- No flash of wrong theme on reload (inline script runs before paint)\n- With no saved choice, OS `prefers-color-scheme` decides\n- Dark window background is #000000; light window background matches libadwaita\n- `pnpm check`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm fmt:check`, `pnpm build` pass","files":null}]}